  "ja230:1.1": "palāsijātakaṃ. dhajamaparimitaṃ anantapāraṃ. ",
  "ja230:1.2": "duppasahaṃ dhaṅkehi sāgaramiva, ",
  "ja230:1.3": "girimiva anilena ",
  "ja230:1.4": "duppasaho duppasaho ahamajja tādisena ",
  "ja230:2.1": "mā bāliyaṃ vippalapi na hissa tādisaṃ ",
  "ja230:2.2": "viḷayhase na hi labhase nisedhakaṃ, ",
  "ja230:2.3": "āsajjasi gajamiva ekacārinaṃ ",
  "ja230:2.4": "yo taṃ pādā naḷamiva pothayissatī’ti, ",
  "ja230:3.1": "dutiyapalāsijātakaṃ. ",
  "ja230:3.2": "kāsāvavaggo aṭṭhamo. ",
  "ja230:4.1": "tassuddānaṃ: ",
  "ja230:5.1": "varavatthacodumakhīṇāphalaṃ caturo ",
  "ja230:5.2": "dhammavaraṃpurisuttama, ",
  "ja230:5.3": "dhaṅkamagadhā ca tayo ",
  "ja230:5.4": "girināma gajaggavarodhajavarena dasa. "
}
